{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22920","headline":"编集拙诗成一十五卷因题卷末戏赠元九李二十 · 白居易","name":"编集拙诗成一十五卷因题卷末戏赠元九李二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一篇长恨有风情，十首秦吟近正声。\n每被老元偷格律，苦教短李伏歌行。\n世间富贵应无分，身後文章合有名。\n莫怪气粗言语大，新排十五卷诗成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}